## RESEARCH ARTICLE
A 7-fold to an 8-fold transformation of MOFs by the loss of DMF is accompanied by a giant enhancement of the SHG and two-photon emission facilitated by the increased π-π interaction and oscillator strength. This demonstrates a way to manipulate the NLO properties of MOFs using interpenetration for tunable singlecrystal NLO devices.
